project (cv, ov, pv) (rows≈10 cost≈10K)
└─ join left [c.ck = o.ok] (rows≈10 cost≈9.8K)
   ├─ source c AS c (rows≈8 cost≈128)
   └─ join inner [p.pk = o.ok] emit-filter 1 from left (rows≈5 cost≈5K)
      ├─ filter (== |p.pv| 1) (rows≈3 cost≈192)
      │  └─ source p AS p row-groups (== |p.pv| 1) (rows≈6 cost≈96)
      └─ source o AS o use-filter 1 keys=[o.ok] (rows≈20 cost≈320)
